ng> alternative, focusing on precision diagnostics to protect your high-value investment.\n                    </p>\n                    <p>\n                        Fixing a modern O General inverter split, a massive cassette unit, or a specialized <strong>O General panel AC</strong> used in industrial control cabinets requires a deep technical grasp of logic boards and high-capacity refrigerant flow. Whether you&#8217;re dealing with a compressor failure late at night, need <strong>emergency O General AC repair in Vasna Road Vadodara</strong>, or require maintenance for a CNC electrical cabinet cooling unit, our technicians have the field experience to solve the issue permanently.\n                    </p>\n                    <p>\n                        Transparency is our foundational value. Because O General parts are premium, many people worry about being overcharged. We do things differently. We provide a complete <strong>O General AC repair charges Vadodara</strong> breakdown before we begin any work. We explain the technical fault in plain language and provide a fixed, honest quote. Experience the peace of mind that comes with hiring an independent squad that values your comfort.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section id=\"services\" class=\"py-16 bg-gray-50 rounded-3xl my-12\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12\">\n                <div class=\"text-center mb-16\">\n                    <h2 class=\"font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-extrabold text-[#1A202C] relative inline-block after:content-[''] after:absolute after:-bottom-2.5 after:left-1/2 after:-translate-x-1/2 after:w-[60px] after:h-1 after:bg-[#D4AF37] after:rounded-sm text-3xl md:text-5xl mb-6 m-0\">Our Core Technical Portfolio</h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-4 m-0\">From extreme domestic cooling troubleshooting to critical industrial panel interventions.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-10 m-0\">\n                    <article class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-100 shadow-lg group transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2.5 hover:shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\">\n                        <div class=\"relative h-56 overflow-hidden m-0\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[#1A202C]/20 group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors z-10 m-0\"></div>\n                            <img decoding=\"async\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transform group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700 m-0\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/ac-repairing-in-vadodara.webp\" alt=\"General O General AC Repair Vadodara\" onerror=\"handleImageError(this)\" title=\"\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-8 flex flex-col h-[calc(100%-14rem)] m-0\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-[#D4AF37]/10 w-14 h-14 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-[#D4AF37] text-2xl mb-6 shadow-sm m-0\"><i class=\"fas fa-tools m-0\"></i></div>\n                            <h3 class=\"text-xl font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-bold text-[#1A202C] mb-3 mt-0\">General Maintenance &amp; Repair</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-6 line-clamp-3 text-sm m-0\">If your O General unit is leaking, struggling to cool, or refusing to start, we provide a scientific diagnostic scan. We specialize in <strong>O General split AC repair Vadodara</strong>, ensuring that every heavy-duty component is restored to factory standards.</p>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-t border-gray-100 pt-4 mt-auto m-0\">\n                                <span class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#D4AF37] m-0\">From ₹399</span>\n                                <a href=\"tel:+919727257141\" class=\"text-[#1A202C] font-semibold hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition-colors flex items-center no-underline m-0\">Call Now <i class=\"fas fa-phone-alt ml-2 text-sm m-0\"></i></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n\n                    <article class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-100 shadow-lg group transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2.5 hover:shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\">\n                        <div class=\"relative h-56 overflow-hidden bg-[#1A202C] flex items-center justify-center m-0\">\n                            <i class=\"fas fa-industry text-6xl text-[#D4AF37] opacity-80 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700 m-0\"></i>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-8 flex flex-col h-[calc(100%-14rem)] m-0\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-[#D4AF37]/10 w-14 h-14 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-[#D4AF37] text-2xl mb-6 shadow-sm m-0\"><i class=\"fas fa-server m-0\"></i></div>\n                            <h3 class=\"text-xl font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-bold text-[#1A202C] mb-3 mt-0\">Industrial Panel AC Repair</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-6 line-clamp-3 text-sm m-0\">CNC machinery panels and server enclosures produce intense internal heat load. Our engineers provide expert <strong>O General panel AC repair Vadodara</strong> in industrial zones to prevent your critical machinery from overheating and shutting down your production line.</p>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-t border-gray-100 pt-4 mt-auto m-0\">\n                                <span class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#D4AF37] m-0\">From ₹1500</span>\n                                <a href=\"tel:+919727257141\" class=\"text-[#1A202C] font-semibold hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition-colors flex items-center no-underline m-0\">Call Now <i class=\"fas fa-phone-alt ml-2 text-sm m-0\"></i></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n\n                    <article class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-100 shadow-lg group transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2.5 hover:shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\">\n                        <div class=\"relative h-56 overflow-hidden m-0\">\n                            <img decoding=\"async\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transform group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700 m-0\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Ac-circuit.webp\" alt=\"Component level O General AC PCB Repair Vadodara\" title=\"\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-8 flex flex-col h-[calc(100%-14rem)] m-0\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-[#D4AF37]/10 w-14 h-14 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-[#D4AF37] text-2xl mb-6 shadow-sm m-0\"><i class=\"fas fa-microchip m-0\"></i></div>\n                            <h3 class=\"text-xl font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-bold text-[#1A202C] mb-3 mt-0\">PCB Motherboard Repair</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-6 line-clamp-3 text-sm m-0\">O General motherboards are incredibly expensive to replace. Don’t discard your inverter board due to a power spike. We provide master-level <strong>O General AC PCB repair Vadodara</strong>, fixing damaged logic board components locally to save you thousands of rupees.</p>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-t border-gray-100 pt-4 mt-auto m-0\">\n                                <span class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#D4AF37] m-0\">From ₹1500</span>\n                                <a href=\"tel:+919727257141\" class=\"text-[#1A202C] font-semibold hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition-colors flex items-center no-underline m-0\">Call Now <i class=\"fas fa-phone-alt ml-2 text-sm m-0\"></i></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section id=\"guide\" class=\"py-16 bg-white relative overflow-hidden\">\n            <div class=\"absolute right-0 top-0 w-1/3 h-full bg-yellow-50/50 skew-x-12 transform origin-top-right z-0 m-0\"></div>\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 max-w-6xl m-0\">\n                <div class=\"text-center mb-16 m-0\">\n                    <h2 class=\"font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-extrabold text-[#1A202C] relative inline-block after:content-[''] after:absolute after:-bottom-2.5 after:left-1/2 after:-translate-x-1/2 after:w-[60px] after:h-1 after:bg-[#D4AF37] after:rounded-sm text-3xl md:text-5xl mb-6 m-0 text-[#1A202C]\">Guidance for O General AC Health</h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-4 m-0\">Protect your investment. A few simple protocols can save you from expensive emergency compressor replacements.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"space-y-12 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-lg text-justify md:text-left m-0\">\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-bold text-[#1A202C] mb-4 flex items-center mt-0\"><i class=\"fas fa-wind text-blue-500 mr-3 m-0\"></i> 1. The Myth of Gas &#8220;Consumption&#8221;</h3>\n                        <p class=\"mb-4 m-0\">\n                            A common industry myth is that air conditioners slowly &#8220;use up&#8221; gas like a car uses petrol. Physically, this is impossible. Refrigerant gas exists in a hermetically sealed copper loop. If your unit is low on gas, it absolutely means there is a physical hole. Simply refilling it without fixing the leak is a waste of your money.\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"m-0\">\n                            Our protocol for <strong>O General AC gas filling in Vadodara</strong> involves a nitrogen pressure test to find the exact pinhole leak, silver-brazing it shut permanently, and then refilling the system with the exact weight of gas recommended by Fujitsu General. This guarantees extreme cooling stability.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-bold text-[#1A202C] mb-4 flex items-center mt-0\"><i class=\"fas fa-leaf text-green-500 mr-3 m-0\"></i> 2. Why Dusty Filters Kill Heavy Compressors</h3>\n                        <p class=\"mb-4 m-0\">\n                            When clients ask, &#8220;<strong>why is my O General AC not cooling?</strong>&#8220;, dust is the usual suspect. Your unit needs to pull massive amounts of air to extract heat. If filters are blocked, the machine &#8220;suffocates,&#8221; and the heavy-duty compressor has to work at double capacity. This spikes your bill and eventually burns out the motor windings.\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"m-0\">\n                            A bi-weekly <strong>O General AC filter cleaning</strong> is something you can easily do at home. Rinse the mesh under cool water, dry them, and slide them back. This small habit alone can extend your unit&#8217;s life by up to 5 years.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"py-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-3xl my-12 shadow-2xl\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-6xl py-12 m-0\">\n                <div class=\"text-center mb-16 m-0\">\n                    <h2 class=\"font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-extrabold text-white relative inline-block after:content-[''] after:absolute after:-bottom-2.5 after:left-1/2 after:-translate-x-1/2 after:w-[60px] after:h-1 after:bg-[#D4AF37] after:rounded-sm text-3xl md:text-5xl mb-6 m-0 text-white\">Diagnostic Fault Guide</h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-xl text-gray-400 max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-6 m-0\">Is your unit displaying blinking lights or letters? Use this technical breakdown of common <strong>O General AC error codes</strong> to understand the fault.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"bg-gray-800 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-700 m-0\">\n                    <div class=\"overflow-x-auto m-0\">\n                        <table class=\"w-full text-left border-collapse m-0 text-sm md:text-base\">\n                            <thead>\n                                <tr class=\"bg-gray-950 text-gray-300 text-sm uppercase tracking-wider m-0\">\n                                    <th class=\"p-6 font-semibold w-1/6 border-b border-gray-800 m-0\">Display Code</th>\n                                    <th class=\"p-6 font-semibold w-1/3 border-b border-gray-800 m-0\">Technical Fault</th>\n                                    <th class=\"p-6 font-semibold w-1/2 border-b border-gray-800 m-0\">Required Protocol</th>\n                                </tr>\n                            </thead>\n                            <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-gray-700 text-base m-0\">\n                                <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-700/50 transition-colors m-0\">\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 font-black text-[#D4AF37] text-xl m-0\">E2 / 2 Flashes</td>\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 font-medium text-gray-300 m-0\">Room Temp Sensor Fault</td>\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 text-gray-400 m-0\">The thermistor measuring your room temperature has shorted. The AC doesn&#8217;t know when to cool. Requires a quick <strong>O General AC sensor repair</strong>.</td>\n                                </tr>\n                                <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-700/50 transition-colors bg-gray-800/30 m-0\">\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 font-black text-[#D4AF37] text-xl m-0\">E3 / 3 Flashes</td>\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 font-medium text-gray-300 m-0\">Coil Sensor Error</td>\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 text-gray-400 m-0\">The sensor on the copper piping has failed. This prevents the unit from detecting freezing coils. Call us to replace the sensor.</td>\n                                </tr>\n                                <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-700/50 transition-colors m-0\">\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 font-black text-[#D4AF37] text-xl m-0\">E5 / 5 Flashes</td>\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 font-medium text-gray-300 m-0\">Comm-Link Error</td>\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 text-gray-400 m-0\">The indoor unit brain cannot talk to the outdoor unit heart. This is usually a wiring fault or a blown board component. Requires an electrical check.</td>\n                                </tr>\n                                <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-700/50 transition-colors bg-gray-800/30 m-0\">\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 font-black text-[#D4AF37] text-xl m-0\">EC</td>\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 font-medium text-gray-300 m-0\">Pressure Failure (Leak)</td>\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 text-gray-400 m-0\">The machine senses dangerously low gas levels. Turn the AC off right away so the heavy-duty compressor doesn&#8217;t burn out, and call us for proper leak testing.</td>\n                                </tr>\n                            </tbody>\n                        </table>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section id=\"pricing\" class=\"py-16 bg-white m-0\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-5xl m-0 text-center\">\n                <h2 class=\"font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-extrabold text-[#1A202C] relative inline-block after:content-[''] after:absolute after:-bottom-2.5 after:left-1/2 after:-translate-x-1/2 after:w-[60px] after:h-1 after:bg-[#D4AF37] after:rounded-sm text-3xl md:text-5xl mb-6 m-0\">Transparent Pricing Model</h2>\n                <p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-6 m-0\">Baseline prices for <strong>O General AC service in Vadodara</strong>. We believe in upfront billing with zero surprises.</p>\n                \n                <div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-1 md:p-8 rounded-3xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm mt-8 m-0 overflow-hidden\">\n                    <table class=\"w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm m-0\">\n                        <thead>\n                            <tr class=\"bg-[#D4AF37]/10 text-[#1A202C] m-0\">\n                                <th class=\"p-5 font-bold border-b border-[#D4AF37]/20 text-lg m-0\">Service Area</th>\n                                <th class=\"p-5 font-bold border-b border-[#D4AF37]/20 hidden md:table-cell text-lg text-center m-0\">Technical Scope</th>\n                                <th class=\"p-5 font-bold border-b border-[#D4AF37]/20 text-right text-lg m-0\">Investment (INR)</th>\n                            </tr>\n                        </thead>\n                        <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-gray-100 text-gray-700 text-base m-0\">\n                            <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors m-0\">\n                                <td class=\"p-5 font-semibold m-0\">Standard Maintenance Scan</td>\n                                <td class=\"p-5 text-gray-500 hidden md:table-cell m-0 text-center text-sm\">Filter wash, drain check, and amperage system log</td>\n                                <td class=\"p-5 font-bold text-[#D4AF37] text-right whitespace-nowrap m-0\">₹399 &#8211; ₹