-12 text-center m-0 shadow-xl\">\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-10 m-0\" style=\"background-image: radial-gradient(#D4AF37 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 30px 30px;\"></div>\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 py-12 m-0 text-center flex flex-col items-center\">\n                <h2 class=\"font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-extrabold text-white relative inline-block after:content-[''] after:absolute after:-bottom-2.5 after:left-1/2 after:-translate-x-1/2 after:w-[60px] after:h-1 after:bg-[#D4AF37] after:rounded-sm text-3xl md:text-5xl mb-6 m-0 text-white\">Serving all Vadodara Localities</h2>\n                <p class=\"text-xl text-gray-400 mt-6 leading-relaxed max-w-4xl mx-auto m-0\">\n                    Speed is our hallmark. If you are searching for <strong>O General AC service near me</strong>, our independent technicians are active across Alkapuri, Makarpura GIDC, Karelibaug, Nizampura, and Tandalja.\n                </p>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 max-w-5xl mx-auto mt-12 m-0\">\n                    <span class=\"px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-white font-semibold backdrop-blur-sm m-0\">Alkapuri</span>\n                    <span class=\"px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-white font-semibold backdrop-blur-sm m-0\">Makarpura</span>\n                    <span class=\"px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-white font-semibold backdrop-blur-sm m-0\">Sayajigunj</span>\n                    <span class=\"px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-white font-semibold backdrop-blur-sm m-0\">Karelibaug</span>\n                    <span class=\"px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-white font-semibold backdrop-blur-sm m-0\">Manjalpur</span>\n                    <span class=\"px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-white font-semibold backdrop-blur-sm m-0\">Vasna Road</span>\n                    <span class=\"px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-white font-semibold backdrop-blur-sm m-0\">Gotri</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"py-12 bg-yellow-50/80 border border-yellow-200 rounded-2xl my-8 m-0\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-4xl m-0\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-start space-x-6 m-0\">\n                    <div class=\"flex-shrink-0 text-yellow-500 text-4xl mt-1 m-0\">\n                        <i class=\"fas fa-info-circle m-0\"></i>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"m-0\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-3 mt-0\">Nominative Fair Use Disclaimer</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-sm mb-4 m-0\">\n                            <strong>We want to be clear that Atlas Aircon is an independent, third-party repair business.</strong> We are not official representatives of, authorized by, or sponsored by the O General brand. When we use the name &#8220;O General&#8221; on our site, it is strictly to inform you that our technicians have the specific training to fix that brand of extreme-weather air conditioners.\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-sm mb-0 m-0\">\n                            We support your right to choose who maintains your appliances. Independent repair shops often provide faster response times than brand-exclusive centers. However, please know that if your AC is still under its original warranty, having an independent company work on it might void that warranty. We provide our own 3 to 6-month warranty on any repair work we perform.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n 